\newlabel{fig:intro}{{1}{2}{A structural conclusion in 35079 complete adult questionnaire responses. Green nodes are guaranteed members of the maximum-degree set under FS-T64. Exactly one dashed link completes each of the two compatible trees. The degree bounds for Q3 and Q10 become exact compared with E64. These are simultaneous nominal 95\% statements for the signed tau-a tree under the stated IID working model; they do not identify psychological causes or clinical targets}{figure.1}{}}
